1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:10,000
ChatVenti - SaaS appointment-booking platform
with an AI receptionist for small businesses.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A business owner logs into their dashboard.

3
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
whatsapp_business_management: the business connects
its own WhatsApp number via Embedded Signup.

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:53,000
ChatVenti (Tech Provider) registers the WABA
and subscribes the app - no manual setup.

5
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:57,000
whatsapp_business_messaging: a customer messages
the business on WhatsApp.

6
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:15,000
The AI receptionist replies within the 24-hour
window and offers appointment slots.

7
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
The business sees and can take over
the conversation from the dashboard.

8
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:57,000
pages_messaging: a customer messages
the business's Facebook Page.

9
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:15,000
The AI receptionist answers automatically and the
thread is available to the business in ChatVenti.

10
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:57,000
instagram_manage_messages: a customer sends
an Instagram DM to the business account.

11
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:15,000
The AI receptionist replies and the conversation
syncs to the business dashboard.

12
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:58,000
One inbox: WhatsApp, Messenger and Instagram DM
all reach the same AI receptionist and dashboard.
